          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi Guddaani waan jed'u, Gaafa guyyaani suni gahe, madda ilmaani Dauditifi worra Yerusalemu dabafi t'uri iraa qulqulleesitu banani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafasi anini maqa waan harkaani boch'ani kad'atani kaani lafa keesa balleesa, nami tokoleeni deebie inqaabatu. Anini ammalle nama raaga ufi tolchufi herega waan boch'ani kad'ataniini kad'atani lafa keesaa balleesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba yo nami tokoleeni ammalle aka raaga ufi tolche, abbaafi haati isa d'alte waan isaani jettu, Atini duu malte, jiraachu himmalle, waan atini maqa AABBO Waaqatini d'ara dubbatteefi. Hojja inni wo himu, abbaafi haati isa d'alte isa woraante ijeefti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja guyyaani sunini gahe, raagi tokoleeni ka, Anini daayya arge jed'e kiyyibu injiru, yokhaani ka raaga ufi tolche woya raagaa keeyate nama sobu injiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo inni waan jed'u, Anini raaganiti, anini nama lafa qotu, haguma d'alad'e anini nama oobru qotu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba hojja nami isi gaafate, Mamadaani qoma ira si jirtu tunini maani? jed'e, inni waan jed'uuni, Anini mana jaalani tiyya keesati akana madae jed'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka tissitu Waaqaa ijeesa jed'ani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
